  "notes": [
    {
      "text": "Sixteen steps make one bar at 120 BPM. The rests do as much as the notes: they're what make it groove.",
      "position": [
        16.0,
        769.0
      ],
      "width": 300.0
    },
    {
      "text": "An envelope into the Noise module's **Level** turns hiss into a hi-hat: 1 ms in, 45 ms out.",
      "position": [
        823.0,
        1100.0
      ],
      "width": 280.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Scene **A** is the verse and **B** the breakdown. A slow LFO glides **Morph** from one to the other and back every 32 seconds: the filter rings, the echoes bloom, the hats wash out. Unplug it and turn **Morph** yourself, or click a pad to jump.",
      "position": [
        1463.0,
        1236.0
      ],
      "width": 320.0
    }
  ]
